---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import { park } from '../data/park';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="How to Get to Lake View Park Islamabad"
  description="How to get to Lake View Park Islamabad by car, taxi, public transport and from nearby cities, with map links and return tips."
  path="/how-to-get-there/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'What is the address or Plus Code for Lake View Park?', a: 'It is on Murree Road, Islamabad, on the shore of Rawal Lake. Set your map to “Lake View Park” or paste the Plus Code shown on this page to navigate.' },
    { q: 'Is there a direct public bus to the gate?', a: 'This guide has not verified a direct bus or metro connection to the park gate, nor a last return time. Use CDA’s transit map and expect to combine a ride with a short walk or taxi.' },
    { q: 'How do I plan the return trip?', a: 'Rideshare and taxis can be scarcer in the evening and after events. Arrange your return with your provider and note the sunset time if you’ll be late.' },
    { q: 'Can I drive from Rawalpindi or the airport?', a: 'Yes — via the Islamabad Expressway and Murree Road from Rawalpindi, and allow extra time from the airport for city traffic. See the dedicated city pages for route detail.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'How to get there', href: '/how-to-get-there/' }]}
  image="/images/lake-view-park-rawal-lake.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Location & map', href: '/location-map/' },
    { label: 'Parking', href: '/parking/' },
    { label: 'Public transport', href: '/public-transport/' },
    { label: 'Taxi & ride-hailing', href: '/taxi-ride-hailing/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Lake View Park is on <strong>Murree Road</strong> in Islamabad, on the shore of Rawal Lake. The simplest way to navigate is to set the destination to “Lake View Park” or paste the Plus Code <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1">{park.plusCode}</code> into your map app.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">By car or rideshare</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Follow Murree Road toward the Rawal Dam / Lake View Park signs. The exact open gate and lawful drop-off should be confirmed with on-site management, especially when busy. See the <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/parking/">parking page</a> for access and tariff notes.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Public transport</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Use CDA’s current transit map to check your actual stop, route direction and the walk to the entrance. This guide has not verified a direct service or a last return departure, so arrange an alternative before you leave (see <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/public-transport/">public transport</a>).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">From Rawalpindi or the airport</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">From Rawalpindi, approach via the Islamabad Expressway and Murree Road; from the airport, allow extra time for city traffic. Both routes are covered in dedicated pages: <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/from-rawalpindi/">from Rawalpindi</a> and <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/from-islamabad-city/">from central Islamabad</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Plan the return</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Rideshare and taxis can be scarcer in the evening and after events. Arrange your return with your transport provider, and note sunset time if you plan a late visit (see the <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/sunset-visit/">sunset visit guide</a>).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Navigation tips</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The most reliable way to reach the park is to pin “Lake View Park” or the Plus Code in your map app and follow Murree Road toward the Rawal Dam signs. Confirm the open gate and lawful drop-off with on-site management when you arrive, especially on busy days.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist items={[
      'Set the destination to “Lake View Park” or use the Plus Code.',
      'Don’t assume a direct bus to the gate — check CDA’s transit map.',
      'Arrange your return ride before the park gets quiet.',
      'Allow extra time for city traffic from the airport or Rawalpindi.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/lake-view-park-rawal-lake.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Lake View Park lakeshore along Rawal Lake, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={1} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
